 Dave Gudsen se pone creativo.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/493vYsumKe5Z0o3OG7MsCXOkEkJ.jpg","released":"2025-06-26T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"66 min"},{"id":"tt24163532:1:2","season":1,"episode":2,"title":"Su felicidad me da tristeza","overview":"Al sentirse estancados, Gudsen y Calderone siguen una nueva pista. Estalla el caos en una misión secundaria. Freddy Fasano reconsidera su futuro.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9pu2rP5OpBdshMnS5WVFCBvhmOy.jpg","released":"2025-06-26T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"56 min"},{"id":"tt24163532:1:3","season":1,"episode":3,"title":"Leche podrida","overview":"Calderone decide buscar respuestas. Gudsen propone un nuevo rumbo para su amistad. Freddy va a las oficinas de Coop’s.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6uB28Qrr645s1A7dViuD9qEyluV.jpg","released":"2025-07-03T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"42 min"},{"id":"tt24163532:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"Fresa","overview":"Gudsen saca a la luz su oscuro pasado. Calderone investiga más profundo. Freddy comienza a transformarse.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rXPlMSnFpL0KHsPmFfMXBHiaaPF.jpg","released":"2025-07-10T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"41 min"},{"id":"tt24163532:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"El tamaño importa","overview":"Mientras Gudsen sale de la ciudad para dar una conferencia, Calderone intenta buscar a su excompañero. Freddy busca venganza.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gYSANhr2wqugtpMFZyGzvGMbLWq.jpg","released":"2025-07-17T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"53 min"},{"id":"tt24163532:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"Madurez","overview":"Esposito y Calderone le exigen a Harvey que entre en acción. Un Freddy rebelde se acerca a un aliado.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5wR565zyOoqxWSGaWrSeWlax1NZ.jpg","released":"2025-07-24T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"53 min"},{"id":"tt24163532:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"Sepulcros blanqueados","overview":"Después de mucho dolor, Calderone se une a una misión encubierta. Gudsen recibe un nuevo mérito y una confrontación inesperada.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/54xsYV9DpGXtODlJbXmeHHOJv2.jpg","released":"2025-07-31T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"56 min"},{"id":"tt24163532:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"Mercy","overview":"Gudsen invierte el guion. Harvey se enfrenta al arrepentimiento. Calderone es forzada a confrontar su pasado.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q4pVzrwRHQmUrWBnnCKi0sCuqtQ.jpg","released":"2025-08-07T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"49 min"},{"id":"tt24163532:1:9","season":1,"episode":9,"title":"Espejito, espejito","overview":"Calderone, desesperada, cobra un favor. Gudsen lucha por el control. Un enorme incendio aviva un enfrentamiento decisivo.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Qd7oVI23KM0we41VWNyB3eAby5.jpg","released":"2025-08-14T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"60 min"}]}}